# NYGGS automation — always on

Read and follow `.cursor/skills/nyggs-automation-standards/SKILL.md` before changing Python automation.

Non-negotiables:

- Page Object Model: locators on page classes only. Tests never use raw selectors.
- Shared actions belong in `src/automation/core/`. Do not copy-paste helpers.
- Multi-step reuse belongs in `src/automation/flows/`.
- Python + Playwright sync + pytest only. No Selenium. No `time.sleep`.
- No hardcoded URLs or credentials. Never commit `.env`.
- Low complexity: one job per function, early returns, clear names, no dead code.
- Allowed patterns: Page Object, Factory, Facade, Settings.
